### Factual Verification & Standards

- **Bureau of Indian Standards (BIS) Hallmarking Mandate (2026):**
  - **Mark 1: BIS Triangular Logo:** Government seal guaranteeing assay verification.
  - **Mark 2: Purity & Fineness Grade:** Laser-stamped as `22K916` (916 parts per thousand or 91.67% pure gold).
  - **Mark 3: 6-Digit Alphanumeric HUID:** Unique Hallmark Unique Identification code assigned to each jewellery article.
  - **Verification:** Verified via the official **BIS Care App** ("Verify HUID" feature).
- **Price Calculation Formula:**
  $$\text{Final Price} = (\text{Net Gold Weight} \times \text{22K Gold Rate per gram}) + \text{Making Charges} + \text{BIS Hallmarking Fee (₹45 + GST)} + 3\% \text{ GST}$$
- **The Mandatory Net Weight Rule:** Non-gold elements (stones, lac, pearls) must be strictly deducted from gross weight prior to applying gold rates.

